    "title": "Winona County proposes 14% tax hike - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 hours ago Last week, the Winona County Board approved a preliminary increase of 14% for the 2027 property tax levy as the county grapples with rising staffing costs, falling federal and state funding, and big maintenance projects. The preliminary rate would be the largest increase in recent years, but board members pledged that the county will bring down the final tax levy increase by its December deadline. Read full article",
